{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I am Rainn...Game writer and developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for being here, please note that you don't need to read Episode 0 before Episode 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can still check out Episode 0 when you finish the whole novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events of Week 20 continue when Ghaith succeeds in escaping, leaving Ayoub confused as to who among the boys helped Ghaith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, Ghaith will attack the boys one by one. Will Ayoub be able to protect his friends, and will he finally be able to stop Ghaith and reveal his identity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting and fast-paced story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More backgrounds and CGs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery for viewing unlocked CGs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743270?t=1759642252","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743270?t=1759642252","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759642252","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759642252","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Na